<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rogers upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rogers upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said analyst Glen Campbell raised the rating on Rogers Communications Inc to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- kept the long-term rating at accumulate.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares finished up 1/4 to 5-7/8 on Friday.</p>
</text>
